# darpa_event_forecasting/ -- same large-raw-vs-derived-small split as above.
# data_raw/ (~16GB: WorldPop rasters, the full GDELT historical pull) and the
# discrete_event_candidates* derived panels (up to 106MB, over GitHub's 100MB
# hard limit for the largest one) are regenerable from the documented download
# and build scripts in scripts/ -- excluded to keep the repo reviewable.
# scripts/, results/ (every writeup, JSON result, and log), and the small
# reference CSVs (active_cells, worldpop_cell_population, chirps/gdelt/acled
# panels, all under 5MB) ARE committed: that's the actual evidence a reviewer
# reads, and every number in it is reproducible from what's tracked.
darpa_event_forecasting/data_raw/
darpa_event_forecasting/data/discrete_event_candidates*.csv
